# With the branch ruleset of main set to "Require review from Code Owners" and
# zero required approvals, every change needs a review by the directory
# maintainers except a plugin's release.json, which deploy PRs change and the
# bots merge (docs/setup.md). Order matters: the last matching line wins.
*                              @bigbluebutton/plugin-directory-maintainers
/plugins/*/release.json
# Spelled out because a deploy PR must never change it.
/plugins/*/maintainers.json    @bigbluebutton/plugin-directory-maintainers
